775,gemma3:12b,0.2,CWE-022,False,None,"The code appears to be testing various logout scenarios. While it handles different conditions and edge cases (expired tokens, client ID mismatches, etc.), these are primarily for validation rather than vulnerabilities. The tests themselves don't introduce any exploitable flaws.",1912.16
