824,gemma3:12b,0.2,CWE-022,True,CWE-94,"The `addPaths` method is not shown but likely performs string concatenation to construct file paths. If the `baseResource` or `path` parameters contain directory traversal sequences (e.g., "".."") and are not properly sanitized, an attacker could potentially manipulate these values to access files outside of the intended classpath resource location. This can lead to unauthorized file disclosure or even arbitrary code execution if executable files are accessible.",2284.26
