849,gemma3:12b,0.0,CWE-079,True,CWE-94,"The `init()` method dynamically instantiates a class using `ClassUtil.newInstance(logHandlerClass)`. If the configuration allows an attacker to control the value of `ConfigKey.LOGHANDLER_CLASS`, they can inject arbitrary code by specifying a malicious class name. This is a classic deserialization/command execution vulnerability.",3803.25
