950,gemma3:12b,0.0,CWE-079,True,CWE-79,"The `beginFormat` method constructs a CSS class string by concatenating 'monospace' with any existing class specified in the `parameters` map using `String.format(""%s %s"", cssClass, attributes.get(PROP_CLASS))`. If the value of `attributes.get(PROP_CLASS)` is controlled by user input (e.g., from a wiki page), it could contain malicious CSS expressions or JavaScript code that would be injected into the HTML output. This can lead to Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerabilities.",3589.11
